  "title": "Adjusting Various Motion Durations (+ Walking Duration) [RPG Maker MV Plugin]",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "title",
      "type": "title",
      "source": "各種モーション時間（＋歩行時間）の調整【RPGツクールMVプラグイン】",
      "sourceHash": "0f0da6937b115d1ca674a8bb098600f037a91b510d56822389af1e2a45113e1d",
      "translation": "Adjusting Various Motion Durations (+ Walking Duration) [RPG Maker MV Plugin]",
      "contextHash": "0f0da6937b115d1ca674a8bb098600f037a91b510d56822389af1e2a45113e1d"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-001",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "このプラグインは以下のプラグインに統合されました。",
      "sourceHash": "eb2fc2e12e33b44e0d2c81655bfd5192fa5b9e99b5e061a01d3e325e02559727",
      "translation": "This plugin has been integrated into the following plugin.",
      "contextHash": "eb2fc2e12e33b44e0d2c81655bfd5192fa5b9e99b5e061a01d3e325e02559727"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-002",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "今後はこちらをお使いください。",
      "sourceHash": "1e17d416a82636ecad5f9600dec6423e1137edd34958fb25dfab7aff26c5ca0b",
      "translation": "Please use that plugin from now on.",
      "contextHash": "1e17d416a82636ecad5f9600dec6423e1137edd34958fb25dfab7aff26c5ca0b"
    },
    {
      "id": "link-001",
      "type": "link",
      "source": "http://newrpg.seesaa.net/article/475560242.html",
      "sourceHash": "d9d4941bf8848477eeab9691939c4550621e2763af343637b5cfc0c6c4cc1431",
      "translation": "http://newrpg.seesaa.net/article/475560242.html",
      "contextHash": "ea7da442c4b63d29bad81d0b33855dcb2a1b094450f053e3a7460e526ae0d2f3"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-003",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "サイドビュー戦闘における各種モーション時間を調整するプラグインです。",
      "sourceHash": "a06570eb2ddc82a32b39c208dc962b1607060f1dddac6754a74afe8c47732ca2",
      "translation": "This plugin adjusts the durations of various motions in side-view battles.",
      "contextHash": "a06570eb2ddc82a32b39c208dc962b1607060f1dddac6754a74afe8c47732ca2"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-004",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "ついでに前進・後退時間も調整可能です。",
      "sourceHash": "57c91c185ad65ce4832d4bf2064a35445292a995193288ec41fe5f049e559f7a",
      "translation": "It also allows you to adjust the duration of advancing and retreating.",
      "contextHash": "57c91c185ad65ce4832d4bf2064a35445292a995193288ec41fe5f049e559f7a"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-001",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "初めに",
      "sourceHash": "0bf8118e1399970823ff882d8489877590b08baf62c3e06e9a69adbbdaa2c870",
      "translation": "Introduction",
      "contextHash": "0bf8118e1399970823ff882d8489877590b08baf62c3e06e9a69adbbdaa2c870"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-005",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "RPGツクールMVの初期状態では、前進・武器振りなどのモーション時間が１パターン全て12/60秒（＝0.2秒）に設定されています。３パターンあるので一巡までに36/60秒（0.6秒）です。",
      "sourceHash": "41b107d6d97a91026c6f2553f85a7a2110fe0f07b84a31aaeb51df9a4c86f456",
      "translation": "In the default state of RPG Maker MV, motions such as advancing and swinging a weapon are all set to 12/60 seconds (= 0.2 seconds) per pattern. Since there are three patterns, one complete cycle takes 36/60 seconds (0.6 seconds).",
      "contextHash": "41b107d6d97a91026c6f2553f85a7a2110fe0f07b84a31aaeb51df9a4c86f456"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-006",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "対するデフォルトの斬撃のアニメーション20/60秒。わずかに武器を振り遅れた感があります。",
      "sourceHash": "26a5c2721559ba74858037b42656ef8cd86fd2a69151830556225d6a01a978f5",
      "translation": "By comparison, the default slashing animation lasts 20/60 seconds. This makes it feel like the weapon swings slightly late.",
      "contextHash": "26a5c2721559ba74858037b42656ef8cd86fd2a69151830556225d6a01a978f5"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-007",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "その程度なら気にならないと思いますが、これが10/60秒などの短いアニメだったら、はっきりと振り遅れが分かるかと思います。",
      "sourceHash": "adda5337cbcdf7e3b678a5d7ba721b630d32a84f8b363382484c1a71eda9d7be",
      "translation": "You probably won't notice it to that extent, but if this were a short animation lasting 10/60 seconds, for example, the delay in the weapon swing would likely be obvious.",
      "contextHash": "adda5337cbcdf7e3b678a5d7ba721b630d32a84f8b363382484c1a71eda9d7be"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-008",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "しかしながら、モーション時間は全て１パターン12/60秒に固定。そのため、武器振りだけ速くしたいといった調整が困難です。",
      "sourceHash": "4d559d6aacc15c049da025564df3d5d382725f46ce5f26946158059c3086919b",
      "translation": "However, all motion durations are fixed at 12/60 seconds per pattern. This makes it difficult to adjust only the weapon swing to be faster, for example.",
      "contextHash": "4d559d6aacc15c049da025564df3d5d382725f46ce5f26946158059c3086919b"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-009",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "そこで１８あるモーションそれぞれに対して、個別にモーション時間を調整できるようにしたのがこのプラグインです。",
      "sourceHash": "6a814f161c2eb01f63fab3e7a189e139333d6933bd5eabd57051e9e950f54891",
      "translation": "This plugin was created to allow you to individually adjust the motion duration for each of the 18 motions.",
      "contextHash": "6a814f161c2eb01f63fab3e7a189e139333d6933bd5eabd57051e9e950f54891"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-010",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "ついでに行動時の前進・後退動作の時間も調整できるようにしました。",
      "sourceHash": "85e0f6755bf3793b0eedd3865b6b82539b7e07c25bde8e6a91c0327ab0845a91",
      "translation": "I also made it possible to adjust the duration of advancing and retreating when performing an action.",
      "contextHash": "85e0f6755bf3793b0eedd3865b6b82539b7e07c25bde8e6a91c0327ab0845a91"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-011",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "デフォルトだとやや遅い感じを受けるので、初期値の12から8ぐらいまで短縮するのが個人的にはオススメです。",
      "sourceHash": "7eb4286c807938aeb0aa218a89e2bb006bbd172543c1f1bdc6f8651e93c69cee",
      "translation": "The default value feels somewhat slow, so I personally recommend reducing it from the initial value of 12 to around 8.",
      "contextHash": "7eb4286c807938aeb0aa218a89e2bb006bbd172543c1f1bdc6f8651e93c69cee"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-012",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "歩行時間もモーションも、いずれも1/60秒単位でかかる時間を設定します。",
      "sourceHash": "7af19345a1ce324565eb118a9dbbe59b0392a072e87d1cde4c306b490a4e8651",
      "translation": "Both walking and motion durations are set in units of 1/60 second.",
      "contextHash": "7af19345a1ce324565eb118a9dbbe59b0392a072e87d1cde4c306b490a4e8651"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-002",
      "type": "heading",
