    },
    {
      "id": "heading-009",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "前進（コマンド待ち）（walk）",
      "sourceHash": "876247fd89c11efe3faeac6bfbe1e30ebb91dba147d9462e0e9f8cd8918ef7c5",
      "translation": "Advance (Command Wait) (walk)",
      "contextHash": "876247fd89c11efe3faeac6bfbe1e30ebb91dba147d9462e0e9f8cd8918ef7c5"
    },
    {
      "id": "list-008",
      "type": "list",
      "source": "前進時のモーション時間です。",
      "sourceHash": "eca97d9f291002c9a21c62a68d263bb66fbe3e2e856fb2e25eb079d306ae3078",
      "translation": "This is the motion duration while advancing.",
      "contextHash": "eca97d9f291002c9a21c62a68d263bb66fbe3e2e856fb2e25eb079d306ae3078"
    },
    {
      "id": "list-009",
      "type": "list",
      "source": "MVのヘルプでは『前進』となっていますが、実際にはコマンド待ちや後退時もこのモーションのようです。",
      "sourceHash": "b8201444dfdbc0350b8b84cd677c518b3e1f4c0d60a3b46c549c407c9b37adaf",
      "translation": "The MV help calls it “Advance,” but in practice this motion also appears to be used while waiting for commands and while retreating.",
      "contextHash": "b8201444dfdbc0350b8b84cd677c518b3e1f4c0d60a3b46c549c407c9b37adaf"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-010",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "通常待機（wait）",
      "sourceHash": "ff726447e8a55ef7d099b4f424ec4a4aaa8e8618e726047953a01b472f34ea0e",
      "translation": "Normal Wait (wait)",
      "contextHash": "ff726447e8a55ef7d099b4f424ec4a4aaa8e8618e726047953a01b472f34ea0e"
    },
    {
      "id": "list-010",
      "type": "list",
      "source": "通常待機時のモーション時間です。",
      "sourceHash": "9c475b46da4ed116d7781b29d95ba8a3ceb0c13776ac737fe3cf0f08b15a569f",
      "translation": "This is the motion duration during a normal wait.",
      "contextHash": "9c475b46da4ed116d7781b29d95ba8a3ceb0c13776ac737fe3cf0f08b15a569f"
    },
    {
      "id": "list-011",
      "type": "list",
      "source": "正確にはコマンド入力後の待機状態を指します。",
      "sourceHash": "1cd63483f7581f54d5918ac71b23a721190b9c215fbf7c446d1522a342e84873",
      "translation": "More precisely, it refers to the waiting state after command input.",
      "contextHash": "1cd63483f7581f54d5918ac71b23a721190b9c215fbf7c446d1522a342e84873"
    },
    {
      "id": "list-012",
      "type": "list",
      "source": "……後は大体そのまんまなので、解説を省略します。",
      "sourceHash": "a2487ff004cc805561c2cf36bf32cff8fa1bc2566bb0f9e727bed7611477a92a",
      "translation": "…The rest are more or less self-explanatory, so I’ll omit the explanations.",
      "contextHash": "a2487ff004cc805561c2cf36bf32cff8fa1bc2566bb0f9e727bed7611477a92a"
    },
    {
      "id": "list-013",
      "type": "list",
      "source": "（すみません、面倒臭くなりました。）",
      "sourceHash": "bbf68c6a555cb23b8a40810005d8fbe81651c499d61c6f71a3fe3831a935af48",
      "translation": "(Sorry, I got lazy.)",
      "contextHash": "bbf68c6a555cb23b8a40810005d8fbe81651c499d61c6f71a3fe3831a935af48"
    },
    {
